#==============================================================================================
#
#   grid_formatting_context_4 - Layout::GridFormattingContext: maximizing, flexible and auto
#                               tracks, grid areas, the placement algorithm and the second row
#                               layout
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/GridFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1123-1611): steps 3 to 5 of the
#       track sizing algorithm (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-2/#algo-grow-tracks,
#       https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid/#algo-flex-tracks with "find the size of an fr",
#       https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-2/#algo-stretch) and its driver, the implicitly-assigned
#       line names of grid-template-areas, the grid item placement algorithm
#       (https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid/#auto-placement-algo) in order-modified document
#       order, and the grid container's automatic height with the second row track sizing
#       pass against it.
